      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ❌ FIX 1 — Ghost Session Trap\nIf the admin types /cancel at any point while a session is open, this branch immediately deletes their Pending_Revisions row and sends a clear confirmation. The session is gone — future messages will not be misrouted.",
