    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 FIX 3 — LLM Parsing (No Regex)\nInstead of fragile regex, the admin's raw message is passed to GPT-4o-mini with a strict JSON-only prompt. It handles typos, casual phrasing, and multi-day messages naturally. The Code node below safely parses the returned JSON array and validates it has at least one item before proceeding.",
