      "id": "f569af3e-b416-449a-b465-dadfe366839b",
      "name": "LLM Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💾 STEP 3 — Save & Confirm\nEach item from the LLM array (one per day) is looped through: Supabase Content_Calendar updated with the comment for that specific day_number + client_id, then Google Sheets Comment column updated matched by Day Number. Session deleted before the loop. Telegram confirmation lists every day and its comment.",
